sequenceDiagram
    participant Customer01
    participant PostBillPay
    participant XML
    participant SPDB as SP dB
    participant FZ as FZ Processing

    Note over Customer01,PostBillPay: Billpay Code = 8929
    Note over SPDB,FZ: Alias = EE1EE5A6-AED5-4561-AD6D-EDB1DD647AF

    Customer01->>PostBillPay: 1. Choose Billpay code (8929)

    PostBillPay->>SPDB: 2. Determine Merchant ID from Billpay code
    SPDB-->>PostBillPay: 3. Merchant ID = HNX

    Customer01->>PostBillPay: 4. Choose payment method: Stored card

    PostBillPay->>SPDB: 5. Retrieve stored alias for Payor
    SPDB-->>PostBillPay: 6. Alias EE1EE5A6-AED5-4561-AD6D-EDB1DD647AF returned

    PostBillPay->>XML: 7. Create XML payment using alias EE1EE5A6-AED5-4561-AD6D-EDB1DD647AF for FZ Processing

    XML->>FZ: 8. Process XML payment using alias EE1EE5A6-AED5-4561-AD6D-EDB1DD647AF
    FZ-->>XML: 9. Processing complete

    XML-->>PostBillPay: 10. Payment complete
    PostBillPay-->>Customer01: 11. Payment complete
